Original repository: https://github.com/itpyi/magna
Full license: ../fixtures/original_many_record_input.LICENSE.
Producer: benchmarks/magna_reproduction/original_complex_boundary.py.

The producer runs all five complete unchanged original methods, including
constructor/runtime failures, the independent reference sampler, RNG equality
and full literal branch-sum assertions. It captures50 original sampler draws,
six full source-generated literal tables, and a supplemental literal table of
the fifth method's exact source fixture. Frontend/helper/source/producer hashes
are retained; the entire pinned source is verified before/after capture.
The supplemental table uses the unchanged original exhaustive helper. It does
not replace execution of the complete fifth method. No Native core rebuild or
environment copy is performed.

Rust compares prescribed branch sums and explicit caller-owned word-stream
replay. Python Random seed/implementation identity is not a promised Rust API.
